  "2026-08-19T18:27:32.747Z","harness:codex","Evidence: semantic staleness warnings now resolve executable recovery from live capability registration. When reindex is available the warning points directly to ok: true\nmode: \"hybrid\"\ntotal_items: 2524\nsemantic:\n  enabled: true\n  stale_items: 0\n  unchanged_items: 2524\n  embedded_items: 0\n  vector_upserted: 0\n  batches_completed: 0\nartifacts:\n  manifest: \"index/manifest.json\"\n  embeddings: \"search/embeddings.jsonl\"\nwarnings:\n  - \"search_semantic_reindex_skipped_unchanged:count=2524\"\ngenerated_at: \"2026-08-19T18:27:31.202Z\"; when absent it emits the two-step ok: true\naction: \"install\"\nscope: \"project\"\nroots:\n  project: \"<repo>/.agents/pm/extensions\"\n  global: \"<global-pm-extensions>\"\n  selected: \"<repo>/.agents/pm/extensions\"\n  settings_root: \"<repo>/.agents/pm\"\ndetails:\n  extension:\n    name: \"builtin-search-advanced\"\n    version: \"0.1.0\"\n    entry: \"./index.ts\"\n    capabilities:\n      - \"commands\"\n      - \"schema\"\n      - \"search\"\n    directory: \"builtin-search-advanced\"\n  source:\n    kind: \"builtin\"\n    input: \"search-advanced\"\n    location: \"search-advanced\"\n    name: \"search-advanced\"\n    package: \"@unbrained/pm-search-advanced\"\n  source_resolution:\n    requested: \"search-advanced\"\n    selected:\n      kind: \"builtin\"\n      input: \"search-advanced\"\n      package: \"@unbrained/pm-search-advanced\"\n    ambiguous: false\n    precedence: \"bundled_alias_before_installed_npm\"\n    candidates[1]{kind,input,package,command}:\n      builtin,search-advanced,@unbrained/pm-search-advanced,pm install search-advanced\n  destination_path: \"<repo>/.agents/pm/extensions/builtin-search-advanced\"\n  overwritten: true\n  installed_in_place: false\n  activated: true\n  settings_changed: false\n  runtime_activation_status: \"ok\"\n  command_paths:\n    - \"reindex\"\n    - \"search-advanced\"\n  action_paths:\n    - \"reindex\"\n    - \"search-advanced\"\n  contributions:\n    schema_version: 1\n    commands:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    command_handlers:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    flag_commands:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    search_providers:\n      - \"search-advanced-local\"\n    preflight_overrides: 0\n  command_discovery:\n    package_name: \"@unbrained/pm-search-advanced\"\n    extension_name: \"builtin-search-advanced\"\n    command_paths:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    action_paths:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    help_commands:\n      - \"pm reindex --help\"\n      - \"pm search-advanced --help\"\n    next_steps:\n      - \"pm reindex --help\"\n      - \"pm search-advanced --help\"\n  verification:\n    status: \"ok\"\n    target_pm_root: \"<repo>/.agents/pm\"\n    activation_status: \"ok\"\n    activated: true\n    registered_commands:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    registered_actions:\n      - \"reindex\"\n      - \"search-advanced\"\n    module_graph_verification: \"fresh_in_topology_snapshot\"\n    health:\n      status: \"ok\"\n      blocking_failure_count: 0\n  activation_diagnostics:\n    failed_count: 0 then reindex path. Focused linked recovery-guidance test passed 6/6; contracts, lexicon, full suite, and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage passed."
  "2026-08-19T18:28:17.993Z","harness:codex","Correction to prior noisy shell-expanded evidence entry: semantic staleness guidance is capability-aware. With reindex registered it emits pm reindex --mode hybrid; without it the warning emits pm install search-advanced --project followed by pm reindex --mode hybrid. The accidental expansion also performed a successful local unchanged reindex and extension refresh. Focused guidance tests passed 6/6 and full coverage passed 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-19T19:18:58.841Z","harness:codex","Security evidence: the release secret scan identified host-specific absolute paths embedded in an earlier oversized evidence comment. The PM history-redact primitive replaced repository and global extension paths, recomputed the full item hash chain with zero mismatches, and pnpm security:scan now passes."
